        "quote": "Mr. Speaker, I include in the Record a letter from more than 30 \ncommunity environmental and civic leaders in New York and New Jersey \nurging Congress to defend science-based management of the North \nAtlantic right whale and opposing this legislation.",
        "summary": "defend science-based management of the North Atlantic right whale and opposing this legislation",
